/T (You can set a minimum length of the password. You can ask the users to add at least one number or special character to the password. Assigning the requirements of particular character types, including uppercase letters, lowercase letters, numbers, and non-alphanumeric characters. You can enforce automatic password expiration, prevent the reuse of old passwords, and request for a password reset upon their next AWS sign-in. You can have the AWS users contact an account administrator when the user has allowed the password to expire.)
